DDImage_DDMT.py: code for DDImage<sub>DDMT</sub>, and the code implementing the three MRs, MR<sub>flip</sub>,  MR<sub>rotate+5</sub>, and  MR<sub>rotate-5</sub>.

```
Running  DDImage<sub>DDMT</sub> on three classificaiton models:

python mobilenet_ddmt.py

python resnet_ddmt.py

python vgg_ddmt.py
```

